  - **Setup**: v6 checkpoints (`best/` 111 MB, `checkpoint-3810/`
    329 MB) were rsynced off the Paperspace VM to the laptop; all
    evaluation ran locally on the RTX 500 Ada (CUDA 12.8, torch
    2.8.0). The same 5 held-out PDFs and box-comparison method as
    the v4 and v6_2026-05-09 baselines were used so the numbers are
